<p>
  The core has been <strong>flooded</strong> and its <strong
    >Deadly Doom&trade;</strong
  > is back to destroy everything! Use bubbles of power to keep the core from doing
  something bad.
</p>
<h2>Controls</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Use the arrow keys, wasd, or a controller to move</li>
  <li>Press Escape / Backspace to return to the menu</li>
  <li>Press CTRL to disable bloom, useful if it is running slow</li>
  <li>Desktop users can press F4 / F11 to toggle fullscreen</li>
</ul>
